        "type": "tweet",
        "id": "1975245057880924261",
        "url": "https://x.com/OhgawdEvents/status/1975245057880924261",
        "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/OhgawdEvents/status/1975245057880924261",
        "text": "📢CALLING ALL @TFT PLAYERS!📢\n\nPresenting the next @OhgawdEvents Charity Tournament: THE PRISMATIC PORO CUP!💠⚪️🏆\n\nWith the ongoing crisis and severe flooding in the Philippines, many families continue to struggle. Especially as corruption and government inaction have left vital communities without proper relief. That’s why we’re raising funds for The @ABSCBNFI_ph, which provides direct aid, food, and recovery support to those most affected 🇵🇭\n\n📅Sign-Up Deadline: October 26\n⭐️Tournament Dates: November 6–9\n✍️Register Here: https://t.co/W1cx5p8020\n📺Watch Live: https://t.co/6ADGNVZraU\n💛ABS-CBN Info: https://t.co/z4EGwwWvqO\n💌Donate: https://t.co/kambiBIN3B\n\n#OHGAWDEVENTS | #PRISMATICPOROCUP | #TFT",
